  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">김<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">ᄇᅷ<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">끤<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oR-ca9EW0sE?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">別人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">받랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’앟에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">性命<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">실`먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pat-láng’ah-e sḭ̀-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">框<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">컹ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">金<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">包<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">ᄇᅷˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">銀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">끤ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-khōng-kîm kôh-pāu-gín\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">性命<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">실`먀ˉ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">值錢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">닫질ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn&#8217;e-sḭ̀-miā m-tat-jḭ́\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">別人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">받랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’앟 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">開喙<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">퀴ˉ취</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pat-láng’ah na-khūi-chui\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">金言玉語<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.3em\">김ˉ꼔껵끠`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-kīm-gien-giok-gì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">加<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">게ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講話<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">겅ˆ웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn na-si-kē-kông-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">連鞭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">럄미ˆ</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">代誌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">대지</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    liam-mî tio-chût-tai-ji\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">괘`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落塗時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">롷터시ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    koài-gùn’e loh-thor-sí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拄<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">두ˆ-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歹<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">팰ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">八字<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뵣ˆ띠ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tû-tioh-phâ̰i-poêh-rī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">好命囝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">호ˆ먀걀`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    láng si-hô-mia-kià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 듸<ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">죄`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兄弟<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">햘ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn ti-lêh-joè-hiā̰-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">窗外<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">탕ˉ꽈ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">野鳥<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">야ˆᄌᆤ`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">替<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">퇴`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">티ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thāng-goā’e yâ-jiàu thoè-gûn-thí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人在江湖<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.5em\">띤재강ˉ어ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    rin-jai-kāng-ór\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">身不由己<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">신ˉ붇ˆ유기`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sīn-pût-yu-kì\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雖然<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쉬ˉ뗸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">죄`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兄弟<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">햘ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sūi-rien-si-joè-hiā̰-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby> 야<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">真<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">稀微<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">히ˉ삐ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gûn-sîm ya-jīn-hī-bí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">燒酒<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쇼ˉ쥬`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">伴<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">퐐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">度<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">더-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">日子<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띧즤`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siō-jiù phoa̰-gùn tor-rit-jì\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">過去<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">궤`킈</rt></ruby>’앟에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">往事<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">엉ˆ수ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kuè-khi’ah-e ông-sū\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">敢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">提起<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">테키`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    m-kâ̰-the-khì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想欲<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">斡頭行<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">왇ᄐᅷ걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siṵ-bêh-oat-thau-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怎樣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">좔ˆ율ˉ</rt></ruby> 에뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">勇氣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">영ˆ키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    joâ̰-yṵ̄ e-bo-yông-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em;color:gray\">\n    (<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">金<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">包<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">ᄇᅷˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">銀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">끤ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">金<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">包<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">ᄇᅷˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">銀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">끤ˊ</rt></ruby>)\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    (kîm pāu-gín kîm pāu-gín)\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">別人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">받랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’앟에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">性命<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">실`먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pat-láng’ah-e sḭ̀-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">框<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">컹ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">金<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">包<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">ᄇᅷˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">銀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">끤ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-khōng-kîm kôh-pāu-gín\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">性命<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">실`먀ˉ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">值錢<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">닫질ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn&#8217;e-sḭ̀-miā m-tat-jḭ́\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">別人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">받랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’앟 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">開喙<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">퀴ˉ취</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    pat-láng’ah na-khūi-chui\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">金言玉語<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.3em\">김ˉ꼔껵끠`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    si-kīm-gien-giok-gì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">加<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">게ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講話<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">겅ˆ웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn na-si-kē-kông-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">連鞭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">럄미ˆ</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">代誌<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">대지</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    liam-mî tio-chût-tai-ji\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">괘`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">落塗時<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1.1em\">롷터시ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    koài-gùn’e loh-thor-sí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">拄<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">두ˆ-</rt></ruby>둏<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">歹<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">팰ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">八字<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뵣ˆ띠ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tû-tioh-phâ̰i-poêh-rī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">好命囝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">호ˆ먀걀`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    láng si-hô-mia-kià̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 듸<ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">죄`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">兄弟<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">햘ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    gùn ti-lêh-joè-hiā̰-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\"